% expect-error: execstackoverflow
% oracle: skip no execution-stack limit reached by the reference within the timeout
% Scenario: a procedure that calls itself without bound exhausts the
% execution stack; the interpreter reports the error and does not crash.
% Expect: the job ends with execstackoverflow.
/f { f } def
f
